{"4224430": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Toey Weedz Smoke Dead Mirror", "steam_appid": 4224430, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4963230], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ultimate next-level nonsense</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toey Weedz Smoke Dead Mirror is the final nail in the coffin of what little sanity you have left.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive even deeper into the story of Toey Weedz, his homie the famous rapping cow, and his eternal nemesis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And experience a fateful tale of a global conspiracy in this uniquely designed, comic-book-style 3D fantasy world, full of war and violence, eternal friends and enemies—all those things that are pretty crazy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4224430/extras/0279a45cf3a44b522eb0fb7827d38747.poster.avif?t=1784641062\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4224430/extras/0279a45cf3a44b522eb0fb7827d38747.webm?t=1784641062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4224430/extras/0279a45cf3a44b522eb0fb7827d38747.mp4?t=1784641062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A complete single-player campaign in the tradition of classic retro military shooters</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 varied levels in a stylish, unique, 3D fantasy world with a cel-shaded look</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humorous interludes and wickedly dark humor, typical of the Toey Weedz video game series</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatic save point system</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 different difficulty levels</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utterly ridiculous characters and voice lines, all recorded by the developer himself with a rather poor microphone</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4224430/extras/f98dca5e71d78866727d20b10c239e82.poster.avif?t=1784641062\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4224430/extras/f98dca5e71d78866727d20b10c239e82.webm?t=1784641062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4224430/extras/f98dca5e71d78866727d20b10c239e82.mp4?t=1784641062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilizing the latest technical advantages of Unreal Engine 5 and the original retro 3D style created specifically for the Toey Weedz video game series, further developed into a cel-shaded look for this installment, Tobias Alexander Knobloch has once again created a unique 3D video game that you won't soon forget, yeah!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ultimate next-level nonsense</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toey Weedz Smoke Dead Mirror is the final nail in the coffin of what little sanity you have left.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive even deeper into the story of Toey Weedz, his homie the famous rapping cow, and his eternal nemesis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And experience a fateful tale of a global conspiracy in this uniquely designed, comic-book-style 3D fantasy world, full of war and violence, eternal friends and enemies—all those things that are pretty crazy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam